    "transcript": [
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 36364,
            "text": "Hi, thanks for having us, ready when you are."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 50000,
            "end": 86364,
            "text": "Hi there, appreciate you carving out a few minutes."
          },
          {
            "start": 86365,
            "end": 109091,
            "text": "Hi, thanks for making room for this on your calendar."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 118182,
            "end": 127273,
            "text": "Before we get into it, things have been steady on our end overall."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 136364,
            "end": 163636,
            "text": "That works, I will follow along and flag anything I need to check on."
          },
          {
            "start": 163637,
            "end": 204545,
            "text": "Let's start wherever is most useful for you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 218182,
            "end": 222727,
            "text": "Staff who move departments still show up with their prior access weeks later because the provisioning sync does not pick up the role change."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 227273,
            "end": 259091,
            "text": "One of our regional coordinators moved roles in July and kept her prior permissions for almost six weeks before IT caught it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 263636,
            "end": 281818,
            "text": "That is useful, I just want to nail down one detail."
          },
          {
            "start": 281819,
            "end": 290909,
            "text": "How long did it take before anyone noticed the access had not updated?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 295455,
            "end": 340909,
            "text": "Close to six weeks, until she tried to approve something she should not have had access to."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 350000,
            "end": 359091,
            "text": "Good, let's shift gears for a minute, anything else worth mentioning?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 372727,
            "end": 413636,
            "text": "It has been a season of change with a few new faces around."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 427273,
            "end": 436364,
            "text": "Nice that you were able to promote from within."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 440909,
            "end": 463636,
            "text": "Our renewal reminders go out about six weeks before the anniversary date."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 472727,
            "end": 509091,
            "text": "Nice to hear the numbers are holding steady."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 522727,
            "end": 563636,
            "text": "Our new hires go through a couple weeks of training before they are on their own."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 577273,
            "end": 618182,
            "text": "Sounds like a solid onboarding process."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 627273,
            "end": 668182,
            "text": "Our development director left for another organization last month."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 677273,
            "end": 718182,
            "text": "Appreciate you letting us know, we can adjust support as needed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 722727,
            "end": 731818,
            "text": "We send a short renewal survey out once the cycle wraps up."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 745455,
            "end": 750000,
            "text": "Renewal season can be a lot, glad the team is staying on top of it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 763636,
            "end": 809091,
            "text": "Our volunteer coordinator handles most of the training these days."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 818182,
            "end": 827273,
            "text": "Happy to help put together some training resources if that would be useful."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 840909,
            "end": 854545,
            "text": "We added two people to the team this year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 863636,
            "end": 909091,
            "text": "Good to hear you found someone for the new hire."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 918182,
            "end": 963636,
            "text": "The team has been tracking renewal numbers pretty closely this quarter."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 977273,
            "end": 1004545,
            "text": "Appreciate the update, sounds like a solid cycle so far."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-02",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1018182,
            "end": 1063636,
            "text": "We are putting together some internal documentation to help with training."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1077273,
            "end": 1090909,
            "text": "We are happy to support however makes sense for your team."
